message: "If you cite this computational research thesis, please use the metadata below. No DOI is minted here; do not invent one."
type: thesis
title: "Spatial Transport Identifiability in Desmoplastic Tumours: When a Lumped Burden ODE Cannot Represent a Fibrotic Delivery Barrier"
authors:
  - family-names: Ogbonna
    given-names: Kelechi Emeka
    email: kelechiogbonna300@gmail.com
    alias: cloudynirvana
abstract: >-
  For stroma-rich carcinomas, which observables are required before a
  zero-dimensional burden ODE is structurally capable of representing delivery
  failure? A three-shell filtration-diffusion reduction has four barrier
  coordinates that enter only through two conductances. The time-integral of
  the mean has Fisher rank 1 of 4. The mean time course has practical rank 1.
  Perfusion restores practical rank 2, the conductance subset. Perfusion with
  interstitial pressure reaches rank 3. Adding a collagen-anisotropy reading
  reaches rank 4. A matched-mean fibrotic retune leaves the core unidentified
  by the lumped state. Synthetic generator only. Not a medical device.
keywords:
